\par 2) The sounds of the Shofar remind us of:
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 a)\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls5\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid14512757 {
\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 An alarm
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 b)\tab}A child's cry
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 c)\tab}Lunch time
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 d)\tab}The giving of the Torah at Mount Sinai
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 e)\tab}Abraham willing to sacrifice his son Issac
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 f)\tab}When the Jews will reunite in Jerusalem with Moshiach
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14512757 {\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 
\par }{\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 3) What is a Shofar made of?
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 a)\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls5\ilvl1\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid14512757 {
\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 Plastic
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 b)\tab}Kevlar
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 c)\tab}Wood
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 d)\tab}Animal skin
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 e)\tab}Animal horn
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 f)\tab}French horn
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14512757 {\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 
\par }{\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 4) A Shofar can be made from the horns of which animals?
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 a)\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls8\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid14512757 {
\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 Ram
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 b)\tab}Goat
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 c)\tab}Buffalo
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 d)\tab}Unicorn
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 e)\tab}Elephant
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 f)\tab}Gazelle
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 g)\tab}Deer
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14512757 {\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 
\par }{\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 5) Can a Shofar be made from a cow\rquote s horn?
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 a)\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls10\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid14512757 {
\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 No, cows don't have horns
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 b)\tab}Yes, it reminds us of the Para Adumah
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 c)\tab}No, it is called a "keren" not a "Shofar"
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 d)\tab}Yes, the sound is very moo-ving
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 e)\tab}No, it reminds us of the sin of the Golden Calf
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14512757 {\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 
\par }{\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 6) Why is a Shofar curved?
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 a)\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls12\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid14512757 {
\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 So you can't see through
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 b)\tab}That's the way it grows on the animal
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 c)\tab}To improve the sound
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 d)\tab}To remind us to bend our will before G-d
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 e)\tab}To remind us to bend our appetite during the long service
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14512757 {\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 
\par 
\par }{\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 7) How long must a Shofar be?
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 a)\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls14\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid14512757 {
\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 An inch
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 b)\tab}A wrist-width
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 c)\tab}A hands-breadth
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 d)\tab}A bread-length
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14512757 {\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 
\par }{\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 8) Who must hear the Shofar?
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 a)\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls16\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid14512757 {
\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 Only Men 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 b)\tab}Rabbis and teachers
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 c)\tab}Musicians
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 d)\tab}Synagogue members only
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 e)\tab}All Jewish men, women and children
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14512757 {\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 
\par }{\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 9) Number the Shofar sounds from longest to shortest:
\par ___ Tekiah
\par ___ Tekiah Gedola
\par ___ Truah
\par ___ Shvorim
\par }{\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 
\par }{\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 10) How can a Shofar be decorated?
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 a)\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls18\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid14512757 {
\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 Only by a well-known artist
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 b)\tab}With semi-precious stones
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 c)\tab}With gold and silver plating
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 d)\tab}It's better not to since it may change the sound
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14512757 {\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 
\par }{\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 11) Name a defect that makes a Shofar unfit for use on Rosh Hashana:
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 a)\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls20\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid14512757 {
\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 A hole
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 b)\tab}A crack
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 c)\tab}An unsanded exterior
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 d)\tab}Not tuned properly
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 e)\tab}Smaller than a hand-breadth
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14512757 {\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 
\par }{\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 12) If Rosh Hashana occurs on Shabbat do we blow the Shofar?
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 a)\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls22\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid14512757 {
\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 No
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 b)\tab}Yes, depending on the size of the crowd
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 c)\tab}It's up to the Temple sisterhood to decide
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 d)\tab}Yes, if it's not raining outside
\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14512757 {\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 
\par }{\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 13) What special things do we do on Rosh Hashana?
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 a)\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\jclisttab\tx720\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls24\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid14512757 {
\f0\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 Eat sweet foods
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 b)\tab}Eat fish
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 c)\tab}Dip apples in honey
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 d)\tab}Dip fingers in hot beeswax
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 e)\tab}Say Tehillim (Psalms)
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\fs21\insrsid14512757\charrsid6311911 \hich\af0\dbch\af0\loch\f0 f)\tab}Make good resolutions}{\f0\fs21\insrsid3813084\charrsid6311911 
\par }}